WEBVTT

00:00:01.330 --> 00:00:03.880
Having arrived at the Ancient Capital Garm,

00:00:03.880 --> 00:00:07.580
Akari and I headed for the cathedral
to see Archbishop Orwell.

00:00:07.580 --> 00:00:14.080
Akari thinks that the ritual we're about to perform
is for sending her back to her own world.

00:00:14.080 --> 00:00:20.540
But actually, it's for eliminating dangerous
otherworlders who possess Pure Concepts.

00:00:21.580 --> 00:00:24.670
Menou! Come on, hurry!

00:00:24.670 --> 00:00:28.960
Don't worry, we have plenty of time to see the sights.

00:00:29.130 --> 00:00:33.420
Well, I want to spend as much time as I can with you!

00:00:34.380 --> 00:00:35.790
Oh, Akari.

00:01:07.500 --> 00:01:09.790
Ahh, that was so much fun!

00:01:09.960 --> 00:01:12.630
You must be tired. Why don't you take a bath?

00:01:12.630 --> 00:01:13.460
Yeah!

00:01:13.460 --> 00:01:16.580
Oh, I know. Do you want to take one together?

00:01:16.580 --> 00:01:17.830
We could wash each other!

00:01:18.250 --> 00:01:19.830
"Wash each other"?

00:01:19.830 --> 00:01:25.170
Akari, you're a little too intimate with people.
You should be careful.

00:01:25.170 --> 00:01:27.000
What? That's not true!

00:01:27.210 --> 00:01:31.880
Like I said before, meeting you feels like fate, Menou!

00:01:33.670 --> 00:01:34.880
Okay.

00:01:35.330 --> 00:01:40.330
I'm very offended if you think
I act like this with just anyone!

00:01:40.330 --> 00:01:43.250
I only said what I said because I
like you so much, Menou!

00:01:43.250 --> 00:01:46.330
Well, yeah... I know that.

00:01:46.750 --> 00:01:48.580
Do you really, though?

00:01:48.710 --> 00:01:55.210
Do you really get my overflowing desire to spend what
little time we have left as intimately as possible?

00:01:55.500 --> 00:01:58.880
Come on, Menou! It'll bring us closer together!

00:01:59.750 --> 00:02:03.040
Right, right. Just go take your bath, okay?

00:02:03.040 --> 00:02:04.330
On your own, please.

00:02:04.330 --> 00:02:06.500
You don't get it at all!

00:02:06.920 --> 00:02:12.250
Jeez! You'd better not regret turning this down later!

00:02:15.880 --> 00:02:19.960
Akari says she likes me so much, but tomorrow...

00:02:20.250 --> 00:02:21.290
I'm going...

00:02:21.710 --> 00:02:22.880
to kill her.

00:03:53.040 --> 00:03:57.380
<b>Episode 5: Goodbye</b>

00:03:53.330 --> 00:03:54.880
Menou!

00:03:55.040 --> 00:03:56.710
Momo, thanks for taking the job.

00:03:56.710 --> 00:03:59.960
It breaks my heart that I don't get to see you today!

00:04:00.040 --> 00:04:03.670
Your Momo wants to feel your
warmth up close and in person!

00:04:05.250 --> 00:04:08.710
Momo being the same as ever is kind of reassuring.

00:04:08.710 --> 00:04:10.540
Is something the matter, Menou?

00:04:10.630 --> 00:04:12.000
It's nothing.

00:04:12.000 --> 00:04:16.170
So, how is it going with your investigation
on the missing women?

00:04:17.880 --> 00:04:19.540
All good!

00:04:19.540 --> 00:04:26.670
You know how Garm's a rotten city where they
bury anything that's not pretty underground?

00:04:27.460 --> 00:04:29.960
That's a crude way of putting it, but you're right.

00:04:30.170 --> 00:04:35.880
Rumor has it that anything shady is done
in the massive underground sewers,

00:04:35.880 --> 00:04:39.130
so I interviewed some of the
homeless who live down there.

00:04:39.130 --> 00:04:42.130
Brilliant, Momo. You know just where to look.

00:04:42.130 --> 00:04:44.960
Hee hee! More praise, please!

00:04:45.040 --> 00:04:47.420
Momo. Can we get on with this?

00:04:47.750 --> 00:04:48.920
Sure.

00:04:48.920 --> 00:04:53.040
So then, I found someone who
saw a shady group of people.

00:04:53.040 --> 00:04:54.580
And the place where they saw them...

00:04:55.130 --> 00:04:57.290
was near the former royal palace.

00:04:57.580 --> 00:05:00.790
The former palace... That's Noblesse territory.

00:05:00.790 --> 00:05:05.670
That agrees with your theory that the Noblesse
here might have something to do with it.

00:05:05.670 --> 00:05:09.000
So I'm about to go look into that now.

00:05:09.210 --> 00:05:12.500
I see. Make sure to be careful, Momo.

00:05:12.500 --> 00:05:13.580
Of course!

00:05:13.580 --> 00:05:16.880
I'm hoping for a nice big reward when I'm done!

00:05:17.130 --> 00:05:19.210
All right, I'll think about it.

00:05:19.210 --> 00:05:21.670
Then off I go!

00:05:23.210 --> 00:05:24.580
A reward, huh?

00:05:24.580 --> 00:05:28.290
It's true I ask so much of Momo all the time.

00:05:28.290 --> 00:05:30.830
Maybe I should get her something for once.

00:05:33.290 --> 00:05:35.630
It feels like I just got here!

00:05:36.000 --> 00:05:39.080
But it's a nice place, your world over here.

00:05:39.330 --> 00:05:41.500
I'm glad you feel that way.

00:05:41.750 --> 00:05:45.580
Now that I know I can go back,
I wish I could have stayed a little longer.

00:05:45.580 --> 00:05:49.500
I probably won't get the chance to come
to another world again, after all.

00:05:49.500 --> 00:05:51.330
Oh come on, Akari.

00:05:51.330 --> 00:05:52.580
Oh, a street vendor!

00:05:52.580 --> 00:05:53.670
Let's take a look!

00:05:55.920 --> 00:05:57.790
Handmade accessories?

00:05:58.170 --> 00:06:01.170
Garm is famous for this pretty cloth.

00:06:01.170 --> 00:06:04.250
You can buy them ready-made,
but why not make something yourself?

00:06:05.960 --> 00:06:08.790
I'm not that good with my hands, actually...

00:06:08.920 --> 00:06:10.630
I don't know...

00:06:11.080 --> 00:06:12.580
I'll make something.

00:06:16.630 --> 00:06:18.290
There, done.

00:06:18.670 --> 00:06:19.830
Not bad.

00:06:21.000 --> 00:06:22.330
Menou!

00:06:22.330 --> 00:06:25.710
You made two,
which means there's one for each of us, right?

00:06:25.710 --> 00:06:27.710
What? No.

00:06:27.710 --> 00:06:28.960
Huh?! They're not?!

00:06:29.170 --> 00:06:33.540
These are a gift for a junior of mine.
She always does so much for me-

00:06:33.920 --> 00:06:35.330
Uh, Akari?

00:06:35.330 --> 00:06:38.130
Menou, why are you like that sometimes?

00:06:38.130 --> 00:06:40.580
I know you don't mean it, but still!

00:06:41.080 --> 00:06:43.580
Um... So you're upset.

00:06:43.670 --> 00:06:44.670
Well, yeah!

00:06:44.670 --> 00:06:48.080
We're gonna say goodbye soon
and you're not getting me anything?

00:06:51.000 --> 00:06:53.750
Fine, fine. Can I see this for a second?

00:06:58.540 --> 00:07:00.330
There, done.

00:07:02.380 --> 00:07:03.750
There, nice and cute.

00:07:06.250 --> 00:07:09.920
You have such good taste, Menou!
I like that about you, too!

00:07:10.630 --> 00:07:12.420
Thank you, Menou!

00:07:15.210 --> 00:07:17.080
You're very welcome!

00:07:17.080 --> 00:07:20.790
It's perfect for the ditzy flower-head you are,
if I do say so myself.

00:07:20.920 --> 00:07:24.330
Wait, you just said something really mean, didn't you?!

00:07:25.500 --> 00:07:29.460
Hello there, Miss Menou and Miss Akari Tokitou.

00:07:29.580 --> 00:07:31.630
I've been expecting you.

00:07:31.630 --> 00:07:33.960
Thank you for coming to greet us.

00:07:34.290 --> 00:07:37.420
Off we go then, to the ceremonial hall.

00:07:37.500 --> 00:07:39.880
Th-thank you for having me!

00:07:45.540 --> 00:07:46.630
Wow.

00:07:47.460 --> 00:07:49.210
A hidden passageway?

00:07:49.210 --> 00:07:52.170
Not an easy find. Way to go, me!

00:07:53.920 --> 00:07:56.420
Clearly, something's weird about this place.

00:07:56.630 --> 00:08:01.380
This wall material looks like it's
used for some kind of ritual.

00:08:01.380 --> 00:08:02.960
But what for?

00:08:12.000 --> 00:08:14.790
Well, well. What a coincidence, Momo.

00:08:14.830 --> 00:08:15.960
No way.

00:08:16.130 --> 00:08:19.830
Fancy running into you here.
It seems we're destined to meet!

00:08:20.710 --> 00:08:22.920
I wish she'd bite her tongue and die.

00:08:23.170 --> 00:08:25.080
But why are you here?

00:08:25.460 --> 00:08:27.630
This is beneath the former royal palace.

00:08:27.630 --> 00:08:30.080
It's not a place a priestess should be.

00:08:30.580 --> 00:08:34.670
I was asked to run an errand in
return for pilgrimage funds.

00:08:34.670 --> 00:08:38.540
Though I doubt a little princess like you
would understand the concept of labor.

00:08:38.630 --> 00:08:39.920
"Little princess"?

00:08:40.210 --> 00:08:42.750
How delightfully adorable.

00:08:43.080 --> 00:08:45.830
Feel free to call me Little Ashuna from now on.

00:08:46.960 --> 00:08:49.080
Hmm. "Little princess."

00:08:49.210 --> 00:08:50.290
Oh, ugh!

00:08:51.830 --> 00:08:56.290
I went to the former royal palace once I arrived
in Garm and sensed something shady.

00:08:56.290 --> 00:09:00.170
I think the knights here are hiding something.

00:09:00.170 --> 00:09:02.290
Well, they're Noblesse, after all.

00:09:02.460 --> 00:09:03.880
Quite the biting remark.

00:09:03.880 --> 00:09:10.000
Anyway, I snuck into the heavily guarded area
beneath the palace and found you here.

00:09:11.670 --> 00:09:15.420
The little princess is more intuitive than I thought.

00:09:15.630 --> 00:09:16.460
So...

00:09:16.460 --> 00:09:18.920
What kind of "errand" did they send you on?

00:09:18.920 --> 00:09:21.880
Depending on the circumstances,
I think we could work together.

00:09:22.080 --> 00:09:26.460
What, are you stupid? Why should I have to do that?

00:09:26.460 --> 00:09:28.830
And could you stop following me, please?

00:09:35.000 --> 00:09:35.630
Hey!

00:09:35.630 --> 00:09:37.750
What do you think you're doing?!
You want me to kill you?!

00:09:38.670 --> 00:09:40.210
It's because you keep neglecting me.

00:09:40.250 --> 00:09:41.420
Ew, what?!

00:09:41.540 --> 00:09:44.710
I knew it. Those ribbons are your weakness.

00:09:44.710 --> 00:09:47.380
You protected those right away back on the train, too.

00:09:48.290 --> 00:09:51.460
Do they remind you of some precious memory?

00:09:51.460 --> 00:09:54.500
Perhaps they're a present... from someone?

00:10:02.080 --> 00:10:05.960
A girl should have a sense of style.
The Master taught me that.

00:10:06.130 --> 00:10:07.460
You look cute.

00:10:09.790 --> 00:10:11.670
Really, you're unbearable.

00:10:12.040 --> 00:10:15.500
Apparently you have no sense of tact, Little Princess.

00:10:15.500 --> 00:10:17.630
Doesn't your family ever tell you that?

00:10:18.830 --> 00:10:22.790
It would have been nice to have a
family who could say things like that.

00:10:22.790 --> 00:10:26.500
Imply whatever you want. I don't want to hear about it.

00:10:29.380 --> 00:10:29.920
<b><i>Authenticate</i></b>

00:10:29.920 --> 00:10:31.500
<b><i>[Open]</i></b>

00:10:37.250 --> 00:10:39.210
There, go on in.

00:10:41.500 --> 00:10:44.830
I never knew a place like this existed under the cathedral!

00:10:46.790 --> 00:10:50.380
Come, Miss Akari. You go to that altar.

00:10:52.080 --> 00:10:52.960
Right.

00:10:59.170 --> 00:11:00.250
Akari.

00:11:00.790 --> 00:11:02.040
Menou.

00:11:02.420 --> 00:11:04.330
Is this really goodbye?

00:11:04.330 --> 00:11:06.000
I won't ever see you again?

00:11:06.250 --> 00:11:08.630
That's right, unfortunately.

00:11:11.210 --> 00:11:14.750
I wanted to spend more time with you, Menou.

00:11:18.080 --> 00:11:20.710
I feel the same way, Akari.

00:11:20.920 --> 00:11:24.130
But you shouldn't be here in this world.

00:11:24.420 --> 00:11:25.460
It's fine.

00:11:25.670 --> 00:11:27.960
You have nothing to worry about.

00:11:28.460 --> 00:11:33.420
Even if there is any pain,
I'm sure it will only be for a moment.

00:11:36.960 --> 00:11:38.830
Thank you, Menou.

00:11:39.210 --> 00:11:40.750
Off I go, then.

00:11:40.920 --> 00:11:42.500
Right. Akari...

00:11:42.500 --> 00:11:43.630
Goodbye.

00:11:49.880 --> 00:11:51.250
What's this?

00:11:51.580 --> 00:11:54.290
A secret place for a ritual, perhaps?

00:11:54.830 --> 00:11:56.210
Seems that way.

00:12:14.710 --> 00:12:17.540
You've become awfully good friends with her.

00:12:17.540 --> 00:12:20.580
Yes, that's how I acted towards her.

00:12:20.580 --> 00:12:24.040
I see. This must be hard for you, Miss Menou.

00:12:24.250 --> 00:12:28.540
I've killed so many before her.
She's no different than the others.  

00:12:28.540 --> 00:12:30.580
Or at least, I thought so...

00:12:31.630 --> 00:12:34.210
My Master would never feel this way...

00:12:34.460 --> 00:12:37.830
There's no need to compare yourself to your teacher.

00:12:37.830 --> 00:12:43.130
That girl, Flare, always defied common sense,
for better or for worse.

00:12:43.460 --> 00:12:46.750
You're in this world for a reason, you know.

00:12:46.750 --> 00:12:51.500
You have a role to fulfill.
I hope you understand that.

00:12:52.960 --> 00:12:53.790
I do.

00:12:54.210 --> 00:12:55.880
Thank you for that.

00:12:56.500 --> 00:13:01.210
My role right now is to see Akari's
death through to the end.

00:13:02.080 --> 00:13:03.170
<b><i>Record</i></b>

00:13:03.630 --> 00:13:06.920
Statues in the cardinal directions
and overlapping pentagrams...

00:13:07.460 --> 00:13:10.580
This is definitely a teleportation test site.

00:13:11.130 --> 00:13:14.630
Considering this thing is underneath the former palace...

00:13:14.830 --> 00:13:19.290
It's undeniable proof that the
Noblesse of Garm were involved in heresy.

00:13:19.670 --> 00:13:25.830
Perhaps the testing and preparations for the summoning
my father did were conducted here, as well.

00:13:26.080 --> 00:13:27.540
Probably.

00:13:27.830 --> 00:13:28.630
But really...

00:13:28.630 --> 00:13:34.000
I'm amazed they managed to reproduce this
so well when it's exclusive Faust knowledge.

00:13:34.000 --> 00:13:35.420
When they're only Noblesse.

00:13:36.500 --> 00:13:39.170
I'm surprised you have such faith in your own people.

00:13:40.170 --> 00:13:42.880
So they really just sent you on an errand?

00:13:43.630 --> 00:13:46.380
I assumed you were on an internal investigation.

00:13:46.500 --> 00:13:48.880
Excuse me? What do you mean by that?

00:13:49.170 --> 00:13:50.790
As you say...

00:13:50.790 --> 00:13:55.080
The Noblesse don't have the knowledge
or ability to make something like this.

00:13:55.540 --> 00:13:58.880
As one of the Noblesse, I know that better than anyone.

00:13:59.210 --> 00:14:01.500
So tell me, who does?

00:14:03.790 --> 00:14:06.000
That's right, the Faust.

00:14:06.000 --> 00:14:09.420
The Noblesse and the Faust
here are conspiring together.

00:14:09.750 --> 00:14:12.750
The former palace and cathedral
are right next to each other.

00:14:13.080 --> 00:14:15.960
They must have collaborated through
this underground passageway.

00:14:16.210 --> 00:14:19.830
Such a major operation couldn't have
been conducted by the average priestess.

00:14:20.080 --> 00:14:22.830
So, who do you suppose is behind this?

00:14:23.040 --> 00:14:24.330
You don't mean...

00:14:25.420 --> 00:14:25.710
<b><i>Invoke</i></b>

00:14:25.710 --> 00:14:26.670
<b><i>[Communication]</i></b>

00:14:26.710 --> 00:14:27.380
<b><i>Disrupt</i></b>

00:14:26.710 --> 00:14:27.380
<b><i>Communication</i></b>

00:14:28.670 --> 00:14:29.790
I've been blocked?!

00:14:30.210 --> 00:14:33.960
Magecraft for communication?
That's exclusive to the Faust, no?

00:14:33.960 --> 00:14:36.000
Do you have one of your people outside?

00:14:36.000 --> 00:14:37.670
Will you be quiet for a moment?!

00:14:37.710 --> 00:14:38.630
<b><i>Disrupt</i></b>

00:14:37.710 --> 00:14:38.630
<b><i>Communication</i></b>

00:14:40.500 --> 00:14:41.580
This is it!

00:14:44.130 --> 00:14:44.920
I'm connected!

00:14:45.210 --> 00:14:48.000
Menou! Watch out for her!

00:14:50.330 --> 00:14:52.710
Well, it's almost time.

00:14:52.710 --> 00:14:53.790
Yes.

00:14:55.960 --> 00:14:57.250
Akari...

00:15:02.960 --> 00:15:04.170
Momo?

00:15:09.290 --> 00:15:12.540
Oh, is something the matter, Miss Menou?

00:15:15.170 --> 00:15:16.710
Archbishop Orwell...

00:15:17.630 --> 00:15:20.630
So she got past the communication interference?

00:15:20.630 --> 00:15:24.210
I asked for the investigation so I
could separate the two of you,

00:15:24.210 --> 00:15:26.540
but perhaps I underestimated the situation.

00:15:27.540 --> 00:15:30.420
No matter, I'll dispose of you both either way.

00:15:33.960 --> 00:15:35.380
<b><i>Etheric Connect-Scripture,</i></b>

00:15:33.960 --> 00:15:35.380
<b><i>3:1-Invoke</i></b>

00:15:33.960 --> 00:15:35.380
<b><i>[And the oncoming enemy</i></b>

00:15:33.960 --> 00:15:35.380
<b><i>did hear the toll of the bell.]</i></b>

00:15:40.830 --> 00:15:42.960
Those are... the three primary color gems?!

00:15:49.580 --> 00:15:50.540
Menou?!

00:15:50.830 --> 00:15:52.420
Akari, get out of here!

00:15:54.540 --> 00:15:55.580
My scripture!

00:15:55.790 --> 00:15:57.330
Okay, then...!

00:16:03.500 --> 00:16:04.790
Menou!

00:16:07.540 --> 00:16:08.830
Menou!!

00:16:09.790 --> 00:16:11.330
Was that from the cathedral?

00:16:11.540 --> 00:16:12.210
Menou!

00:16:12.750 --> 00:16:13.460
Hold it, Momo!

00:16:19.330 --> 00:16:20.630
I see...

00:16:20.630 --> 00:16:25.040
They wouldn't allow intruders in here
unless they had prepared a trap.

00:16:25.040 --> 00:16:26.330
It only makes sense.

00:16:28.500 --> 00:16:32.000
An automa in dragon form and
a summoned demon, hmm?

00:16:32.380 --> 00:16:33.670
Come Momo...

00:16:33.670 --> 00:16:35.960
Why don't we cooperate against this threat?

00:16:36.210 --> 00:16:39.960
It pisses me off, but sure, just this once!

00:16:48.500 --> 00:16:49.790
What's that?

00:16:52.290 --> 00:16:54.880
The missing women...

00:16:56.330 --> 00:16:57.920
Red material...

00:16:59.170 --> 00:17:01.880
And the summoning of otherworlders in the royal capital.

00:17:02.290 --> 00:17:04.250
Then the one behind it all...

00:17:10.580 --> 00:17:15.920
I still have a long way to go if I'm so easily
fooled by a slight show of kindness.

00:17:15.920 --> 00:17:18.130
No need to feel discouraged.

00:17:18.290 --> 00:17:19.670
The older you get,

00:17:19.670 --> 00:17:25.460
you inevitably become more underhanded
and learn to manipulate the young.

00:17:25.920 --> 00:17:29.630
You're levelheaded and capable for your age,

00:17:29.630 --> 00:17:34.250
but you have yet to be as
vigilant or as underhanded as Flare.

00:17:35.540 --> 00:17:37.630
It pains me to hear that advice.

00:17:37.830 --> 00:17:41.000
Menou?! Menou!

00:17:43.380 --> 00:17:46.000
May I ask what your reason is, for future reference?

00:17:46.580 --> 00:17:51.130
Why would you, when you've earned
everyone's trust in becoming archbishop?

00:17:51.330 --> 00:17:57.080
Of course you wouldn't understand.
All you do is kill, after all.

00:17:58.540 --> 00:18:04.420
When you help too many people,
you come to loathe their pleas for help.

00:18:05.290 --> 00:18:12.920
"Help... Help... Why are you not helping us?
We demand more..."

00:18:13.080 --> 00:18:16.790
The clingy voices never leave me alone.

00:18:16.880 --> 00:18:20.580
When no one is willing to help me, you see.

00:18:26.960 --> 00:18:29.000
This... It's a protective barrier!

00:18:32.000 --> 00:18:38.080
Getting an old woman to babble on might buy
you the time until your aide gets here to help.

00:18:38.080 --> 00:18:39.670
Is that what you thought?

00:18:39.670 --> 00:18:40.960
Well, that isn't happening.

00:18:42.080 --> 00:18:47.170
So what were we talking about?
Ah yes, you wanted to know why I would do all this.

00:18:49.330 --> 00:18:54.500
You see, my lower back has been
aching something terrible lately.

00:18:54.710 --> 00:18:57.880
I can hardly get up in the morning.

00:18:58.750 --> 00:19:01.960
Now at this age I've finally realized something.

00:19:01.960 --> 00:19:04.750
I'm no holy woman.

00:19:04.750 --> 00:19:09.830
I'm just an ordinary person who had
the time and energy to help others.

00:19:10.460 --> 00:19:12.330
But who can blame me?

00:19:12.580 --> 00:19:17.790
I've helped so many.
Can't I get a little something in return?

00:19:18.000 --> 00:19:23.580
I deserve to use that girl's
Pure Concept to restore my youth!

00:19:25.000 --> 00:19:28.710
Your objective is Akari's Pure Concept itself?!

00:19:28.960 --> 00:19:31.380
Let me go! I need to help Menou!

00:19:31.750 --> 00:19:33.460
Quiet down, otherworlder!

00:19:35.250 --> 00:19:37.250
Stay still and this will soon be over.

00:19:38.420 --> 00:19:39.710
All right, begin!

00:19:40.210 --> 00:19:42.790
It was such perfect timing.

00:19:43.250 --> 00:19:48.580
My experiment using young
girls wasn't getting anywhere.

00:19:48.830 --> 00:19:52.540
I gave the Noblesse the means
to summon otherworlders

00:19:52.540 --> 00:19:56.250
so that they would
overlook what I was doing here,

00:19:56.250 --> 00:19:59.790
but who knew it would end up helping me like this?

00:19:59.960 --> 00:20:05.000
Although I never expected Princess Ashuna
to come all the way out here.

00:20:05.500 --> 00:20:11.420
Well, I suppose I have the Pure Concept of Time
at my disposal now,

00:20:11.420 --> 00:20:13.830
so all's well that ends well, no?

00:20:13.830 --> 00:20:15.040
I see...

00:20:15.040 --> 00:20:21.750
I can see how someone like you who fears becoming
decrepit would want Akari's Pure Concept.

00:20:22.580 --> 00:20:27.210
But even with your phenomenal skill in magecraft,

00:20:27.210 --> 00:20:31.040
a Pure Concept isn't
something you can manipulate at will.

00:20:31.040 --> 00:20:34.830
Goodness, Miss Menou.
That's why we have this ceremonial hall.

00:20:36.080 --> 00:20:37.540
I suppose I can tell you.

00:20:37.540 --> 00:20:42.880
That place was originally a test
site for erasing personalities.

00:20:42.880 --> 00:20:44.710
"Erasing... personalities"?

00:20:45.130 --> 00:20:49.540
A place for blanching a person's spirit and soul clean.

00:20:49.710 --> 00:20:51.750
If you wipe an otherworlder's mind,

00:20:51.750 --> 00:20:56.580
all that's left is the Pure Concept
to use as you wish, you see?

00:20:57.210 --> 00:21:02.580
We sourced a fragment of White
from the Starhusk in the northern continent.

00:21:02.580 --> 00:21:07.380
Not even an otherworlder can resist its
power to blanch everything out.

00:21:11.290 --> 00:21:12.330
Akari!

00:21:12.710 --> 00:21:14.420
Not to worry.

00:21:14.420 --> 00:21:17.000
To use the Pure Concept effectively,

00:21:17.000 --> 00:21:21.130
you are just what I need as quality magecraft material.

00:21:21.130 --> 00:21:22.790
I'll use you along with her.

00:21:24.380 --> 00:21:31.000
I only waited ten years because I needed you
to grow into a proper catalyst for my needs.

00:21:31.420 --> 00:21:35.330
Still, I highly doubt you'll comply
without putting up a fight, so...

00:21:36.830 --> 00:21:39.750
<b>Primary Pseudo-concept</b>

00:21:36.830 --> 00:21:39.750
<b>[Red]-Activate</b>

00:21:36.840 --> 00:21:39.750
<b>[Primary Red, cElestIAL MeSSengER]</b>

00:21:51.080 --> 00:21:54.830
A red automa... And one in angel form, at that?

00:21:54.960 --> 00:21:59.130
Considering you've lost your scripture,
perhaps this was overkill.

00:21:59.130 --> 00:22:02.540
Well, I'll go easy on you, so come take it on.

00:23:36.250 --> 00:23:41.000
Next episode: [Regression: Memories, Soul, Spirit].

00:23:36.880 --> 00:23:41.040
<b>Next Episode</b>

00:23:36.880 --> 00:23:41.040
<b>[Regression: Memories, Soul, Spirit]</b>
